.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, B3LYP-D3BJ/def2-SVP. Intrinsic reaction coordinate (IRC) from the transition state. This calculation shows the energy along the reaction path on both sides of the transition state (45 points). The reactant-side branch stopped at the iteration limit at -234.249081 Eh, above the optimised reactants (-234.253772 Eh); the product-side branch ended at -234.326271 Eh, above cyclohexene (-234.335601 Eh).
